# Local working docs — NOT published (design notes, research, diagrams).
# Anchored to the repo root so nested modules (e.g. guard/) can keep their own
# published docs/ directories.
# Exception: ADRs are deliberately public (root AGENTS.md "Deliberately public").
# Excluding /docs/* rather than /docs/ is required — git cannot re-include a
# path whose parent directory is itself excluded.
/docs/*
!/docs/adr/
.DS_Store
/symbrain
coverage.out
.worktrees/
/dist/
.claude/
.omo/
.github/audit/
.github/review/
.github/coverage/
.github/prerelease/
.build/

# --- Symaira internal working artifacts (never published; see root AGENTS.md) ---
.github/app-test/
.github/admin/
.github/branch-protection/
**/docs/adopt/
**/docs/teardown/
**/docs/planned/
**/docs/intern/
**/docs/roadmap.md
PLANUNG.md
ARCHITEKTUR.md
.app-test-build/
